":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p133","chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji130-009","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","title":"司寇","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","quote":"上大夫壺遂曰：「昔孔子何為而作春秋哉？」太史公曰：「余聞董生曰：『周道衰廢，孔子為魯司寇，諸侯害之，大夫壅之。孔子知言之不用，道之不行也，是非二百四十二年之中，以為天下儀表，貶天子，退諸侯，討大夫，以達王事而已矣。』子曰：『我欲載之空言，不如見之於行事之深切著明也。』夫春秋，上明三王之道，下辨人事之紀，別嫌疑，明是非，定猶豫，善善惡惡，賢賢賤不肖，存亡國，繼絕世，補敝起廢，王道之大者也。易著天地陰陽四時五行，故長於變；禮經紀人倫，故長於行；書記先王之事，故長於政；詩記山川谿谷禽獸草木牝牡雌雄，故長於風；樂樂所以立，故長於和；春秋辯是非，故長於治人。是故禮以節人，樂以發和，書以道事，詩以達意，易以道化，春秋以道義。撥亂世反之正，莫近於春秋。春秋文成數萬，其指數千。萬物之散聚皆在春秋。春秋之中，弒君三十六，亡國五十二，諸侯奔走不得保其社稷者不可勝數。察其所以，皆失其本已。故易曰『失之豪釐，差以千里』。故曰『臣弒君，子弒父，非一旦一夕之故也，其漸久矣』。故有國者不可以不知春秋，前有讒而弗見，後有賊而不知。為人臣者不可以不知春秋，守經事而不知其宜，遭變事而不知其權。為人君父而不通於春秋之義者，必蒙首惡之名。為人臣子而不通於春秋之義者，必陷篡弒之誅，死罪之名。其實皆以為善，為之不知其義，被之空言而不敢辭。夫不通禮義之旨，至於君不君，臣不臣，父不父，子不子。夫君不君則犯，臣不臣則誅，父不父則無道，子不子則不孝。此四行者，天下之大過也。以天下之大過予之，則受而弗敢辭。故春秋者，禮義之大宗也。夫禮禁未然之前，法施已然之後；法之所為用者易見，而禮之所為禁者難知。」"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji130-009:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"司寇","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0009","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存原文官爵用稱；授任與任期年月另待有證據的日期主張，不以卒年補任期終點。太史公依本段指司馬談，後段不據相同稱謂自動指同一人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p005","text":"遷生龍門，耕牧河山之陽。年十歲則誦古文。二十而南游江、淮，上會稽，探禹穴，闚九疑，浮於沅、湘；北涉汶、泗，講業齊、魯之都，觀孔子之遺風，鄉射鄒、嶧；戹困鄱、薛、彭城，過梁、楚以歸。於是遷仕為郎中，奉使西征巴、蜀以南，南略邛、笮、昆明，還報命。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m005-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m005-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m005-0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p006","text":"是歲天子始建漢家之封，而太史公留滯周南，不得與從事，故發憤且卒。而子遷適使反，見父於河洛之閒。太史公執遷手而泣曰：「余先周室之太史也。自上世嘗顯功名於虞夏，典天官事。後世中衰，絕於予乎？汝復為太史，則續吾祖矣。今天子接千歲之統，封泰山，而余不得從行，是命也夫，命也夫！余死，汝必為太史；為太史，無忘吾所欲論著矣。且夫孝始於事親，中於事君，終於立身。揚名於後世，以顯父母，此孝之大者。夫天下稱誦周公，言其能論歌文武之德，宣周邵之風，達太王王季之思慮，爰及公劉，以尊后稷也。幽厲之後，王道缺，禮樂衰，孔子修舊起廢，論詩書，作春秋，則學者至今則之。自獲麟以來四百有餘歲，而諸侯相兼，史記放絕。今漢興，海內一統，明主賢君忠臣死義之士，余為太史而弗論載，廢天下之史文，余甚懼焉，汝其念哉！」遷俯首流涕曰：「小子不敏，請悉論先人所次舊聞，弗敢闕。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"xqy_bvp_g1a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"xqy_bvp_g1a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"lxl_vec_rli","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"文武","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"周邵","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0216","start":216,"end":218,"surface":"太王","kind":"person","person_id":"ir9_9eu_qx2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0218","start":218,"end":220,"surface":"王季","kind":"person","person_id":"65h_6hs_e4y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"wh3_77h_m9d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0231","start":231,"end":233,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"ys8_rdi_f0i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0235","start":235,"end":237,"surface":"幽厲","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0248","start":248,"end":250,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0340","start":340,"end":341,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p008","text":"太史公曰：「先人有言：『自周公卒五百歲而有孔子。孔子卒後至於今五百歲，有能紹明世，正易傳，繼春秋，本詩書禮樂之際？』意在斯乎！意在斯乎！小子何敢讓焉。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m008-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m008-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"lxl_vec_rli","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m008-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m008-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","text":"上大夫壺遂曰：「昔孔子何為而作春秋哉？」太史公曰：「余聞董生曰：『周道衰廢，孔子為魯司寇，諸侯害之，大夫壅之。孔子知言之不用，道之不行也，是非二百四十二年之中，以為天下儀表，貶天子，退諸侯，討大夫，以達王事而已矣。』子曰：『我欲載之空言，不如見之於行事之深切著明也。』夫春秋，上明三王之道，下辨人事之紀，別嫌疑，明是非，定猶豫，善善惡惡，賢賢賤不肖，存亡國，繼絕世，補敝起廢，王道之大者也。易著天地陰陽四時五行，故長於變；禮經紀人倫，故長於行；書記先王之事，故長於政；詩記山川谿谷禽獸草木牝牡雌雄，故長於風；樂樂所以立，故長於和；春秋辯是非，故長於治人。是故禮以節人，樂以發和，書以道事，詩以達意，易以道化，春秋以道義。撥亂世反之正，莫近於春秋。春秋文成數萬，其指數千。萬物之散聚皆在春秋。春秋之中，弒君三十六，亡國五十二，諸侯奔走不得保其社稷者不可勝數。察其所以，皆失其本已。故易曰『失之豪釐，差以千里』。故曰『臣弒君，子弒父，非一旦一夕之故也，其漸久矣』。故有國者不可以不知春秋，前有讒而弗見，後有賊而不知。為人臣者不可以不知春秋，守經事而不知其宜，遭變事而不知其權。為人君父而不通於春秋之義者，必蒙首惡之名。為人臣子而不通於春秋之義者，必陷篡弒之誅，死罪之名。其實皆以為善，為之不知其義，被之空言而不敢辭。夫不通禮義之旨，至於君不君，臣不臣，父不父，子不子。夫君不君則犯，臣不臣則誅，父不父則無道，子不子則不孝。此四行者，天下之大過也。以天下之大過予之，則受而弗敢辭。故春秋者，禮義之大宗也。夫禮禁未然之前，法施已然之後；法之所為用者易見，而禮之所為禁者難知。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"董生","kind":"person","person_id":"5qk_j3d_hcd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p010","text":"壺遂曰：「孔子之時，上無明君，下不得任用，故作春秋，垂空文以斷禮義，當一王之法。今夫子上遇明天子，下得守職，萬事既具，咸各序其宜，夫子所論，欲以何明？」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"夫子","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"明天子","kind":"person","person_id":"xqy_bvp_g1a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"夫子","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p012","text":"於是論次其文。七年而太史公遭李陵之禍，幽於縲紲。乃喟然而嘆曰：「是余之罪也夫！是余之罪也夫！身毀不用矣。」退而深惟曰：「夫詩書隱約者，欲遂其志之思也。昔西伯拘羑里，演周易；孔子戹陳蔡，作春秋；屈原放逐，著離騷；左丘失明，厥有國語；孫子臏腳，而論兵法；不韋遷蜀，世傳呂覽；韓非囚秦，說難、孤憤；詩三百篇，大抵賢聖發憤之所為作也。此人皆意有所郁結，不得通其道也，故述往事，思來者。」於是卒述陶唐以來，至于麟止，自黃帝始。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"李陵","kind":"person","person_id":"3tq_5qz_qb9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"yi5_jym_uoz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"屈原","kind":"person","person_id":"e7f_ip0_jk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"左丘","kind":"person","person_id":"asu_nj9_wb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"孫子","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_9fp_dpo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"puu_6hs_m4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"韓非","kind":"person","person_id":"0ze_qgj_quv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ocd_ibe_at1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p059","text":"周室既衰，諸侯恣行。仲尼悼禮廢樂崩，追修經術，以達王道，匡亂世反之於正，見其文辭，為天下制儀法，垂六藝之統紀於後世。作孔子世家第十七。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m059-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m059-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p079","text":"孔氏述文，弟子興業，咸為師傅，崇仁厲義。作仲尼弟子列傳第七。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m079-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔氏","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m079-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m079-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m079-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p133","text":"自孔子卒，京師莫崇庠序，唯建元元狩之閒，文辭粲如也。作儒林列傳第六十一。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m133-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-130","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","source":{"title":"史記／卷130","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷130","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷130&oldid=2609362","revision_id":2609362,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定修訂全文143段，全部篇文。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character